<Project>
  <!--
    Landing file for extra properties on this task library only.
    MSBuild imports it automatically from this directory (search stops here).
    Test, DebugHost, and benchmark projects do not see it.

    Add PropertyGroups here after create if you want them out of the csproj.
    Keep GlobalAnalyzerConfigFiles, AnalysisMode, and pack layout in the
    csproj / Build/*.targets — those must load in that order.

    The template does not emit properties into this file vs the csproj with
    generate-time #if. Sending each property to one disk file or the other
    is theoretically possible (duplicate groups, opposite conditions, or an
    extra source per symbol) and gets ugly fast. Move lines here by hand.
  -->
</Project>
